            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.4.4

This release fixes the table and card layout defects in Personalization Studio.

## What’s improved

- Removed the dark rectangle that appeared beside table headers across Studio pages.
- Replaced reserved legacy scrollbar space with clean overlay scrollbars.
- Made both Learning panels consistently span the full content width.
- Restored all Learning table columns instead of clipping them into narrow cards.
- Simplified empty tables by removing heavy alternating bands.
- Made scrollbar contrast adapt correctly in Dark and Light Mode.

Transcription speed, quality, and Kiki’s fully local privacy model remain unchanged.
]]></description>
